{
  "title": "RDS Multi-AZ · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "다른 AZ의 대기 인스턴스를 두어 DB 장애 조치를 돕는 배치다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span> Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#multi-az-db-instance-deployment\">Multi-AZ DB Instance Deployment</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#multi-az-db-cluster-deployment\">Multi-AZ DB Cluster Deployment</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#synchronous-and-semisynchronous-replication\">Synchronous and Semisynchronous Replication</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#automatic-failover\">Automatic Failover</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#writer-and-reader-endpoints\">Writer and Reader Endpoints</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#backup-and-regional-disasters\">Backup and Regional Disasters</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>39 / 62</span></div><h1>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span> Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span> Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>는 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 Database 복제본을 준비하여 장애 시 복구하는 배포 방식이다. DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance Deployment와 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Cluster Deployment는 복제 구조와 읽기 가능 여부가 다르다.</p><p>시험 문장의 “Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>”만 보고 모든 Standby를 읽기 전용으로 사용할 수 있다고 판단하면 안 된다. 배포 유형, Engine 지원, Endpoint와 Failover 방식까지 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"두 가지 Multi-AZ 배포\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>두 가지 Multi-AZ 배포</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>DB Instance Deployment</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Primary / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> A</strong><small>읽기·쓰기</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Synchronous replication</strong><small>다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>로 복제</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Standby / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> B</strong><small>읽기 제공 안 함</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>DB Cluster Deployment</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Writer / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> A</strong><small>쓰기 처리</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Cluster replication</strong><small>지원 Engine 모델</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Readers / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> B + C</strong><small>읽기와 Failover</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Reader가 제공되는지 판단할 때 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance와 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Cluster를 구분한다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Deployment</th><th scope=\"col\">Topology</th><th scope=\"col\">Readable standby</th><th scope=\"col\">Main purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance</td><td>Primary + Standby / 2 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></td><td>아니요</td><td>가용성</td></tr><tr><td>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Cluster</td><td>Writer + 2 Readers / 3 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></td><td>예</td><td>가용성 + 읽기</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></td><td>Source + Replica</td><td>일반적으로 예</td><td>읽기 확장 / 복제</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"multi-az-db-instance-deployment\"><h2>Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance Deployment<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#multi-az-db-instance-deployment\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Primary와 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Standby를 사용하며 동기식 복제로 가용성을 높인다. 일반적인 Standby는 앱의 읽기 Query를 처리하지 않는다. 읽기 확장이 필요하면 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>를 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"multi-az-db-cluster-deployment\"><h2>Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Cluster Deployment<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#multi-az-db-cluster-deployment\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 MySQL·PostgreSQL 구성에서 Writer와 두 Readable Standby를 세 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 배치한다. Reader Endpoint로 읽기를 분산하고 장애 시 지원 Replica가 Writer로 전환된다. DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance Deployment의 읽기 제한을 이 모델에 그대로 적용하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"synchronous-and-semisynchronous-replication\"><h2>Synchronous and Semisynchronous Replication<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#synchronous-and-semisynchronous-replication\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance 모델은 동기식 복제를 사용하고 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Cluster는 지원 Engine의 Semisynchronous 방식으로 Commit과 복제를 조정한다. 읽기 Replica의 지연·정합성 조건을 이해해야 한다. 모든 Reader가 항상 Writer와 같은 시점 데이터를 반환한다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"automatic-failover\"><h2>Automatic Failover<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#automatic-failover\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Primary 장애·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 장애·지원 Maintenance 상황에서 자동 Failover가 발생할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> Endpoint가 새 Primary를 가리키더라도 기존 Connection은 끊어질 수 있다. 앱의 재연결·Retry·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> Cache 설정이 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"writer-and-reader-endpoints\"><h2>Writer and Reader Endpoints<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#writer-and-reader-endpoints\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Writer Endpoint는 쓰기 대상, Reader Endpoint는 지원 Cluster의 읽기 연결 대상을 제공한다. Endpoint 분산은 Connection 기준이므로 개별 Query를 자동 분리하는 SQL Router로 생각하지 않는다. 앱에서 읽기·쓰기 경로를 선택한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"backup-and-regional-disasters\"><h2>Backup and Regional Disasters<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#backup-and-regional-disasters\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 내부 장애에 대응한다. 잘못된 DELETE나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 전체 장애에 대한 보호는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">PITR</a>·Snapshot·Cross-<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 전략이 추가로 필요하다. Replica가 있다는 이유로 Backup을 제거하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>읽기 확장 없이 장애 자동 전환만 필요하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#multi-az-db-instance-deployment\">Multi-AZ DB Instance</a>가 맞을 수 있다. 읽을 수 있는 두 Standby를 요구하면 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#multi-az-db-cluster-deployment\">Multi-AZ DB Cluster</a>인지 확인한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>문제에 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스 배포인지 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터인지 구분해 읽는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/Concepts.MultiAZ.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/Concepts.MultiAZ.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q054\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q055\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q056\" data-question=\"Q056\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q056</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q056/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS DB instance needs automatic failover, but read scaling is not required. Which deployment should be selected?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DynamoDB DAX</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스 standby는 고가용성을 위한 선택이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q087\" data-question=\"Q087\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q087</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q087/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to improve both availability and read throughput for an existing RDS DB instance. Which TWO options address these goals?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스는 장애 조치, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>는 읽기 확장에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q060\" data-question=\"Q060\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q060</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q060/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Repeated reads of the same product data make database responses slow. Which in-memory layer can cache the data with a short TTL?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon ElastiCache</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">ElastiCache</a>가 빈번한 읽기를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 부담을 줄인다. 무효화와 장애 시 원본 접근도 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">ElastiCache</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">이전 용어 <b>RDS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">다음 용어 <b>Read Replica</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
